sequenceDiagram
    participant Client as External Client
    participant Ingress as Ingress/Gateway<br/>443/TCP TLS
    participant Router as Inference Router<br/>(cmd/router)
    participant AGServer as AutoGluon Server<br/>8080/TCP<br/>FastAPI/uvicorn
    participant Storage as Model Storage<br/>(S3/GCS/Azure/HDFS)
    participant K8sAPI as Kubernetes API<br/>6443/TCP TLS
    participant Controller as KServe Controller<br/>Manager
    participant Webhook as Webhook Server<br/>443/TCP TLS
    participant RBACProxy as kube-rbac-proxy<br/>8443/TCP TLS
    participant Prometheus as Prometheus

    Note over Client,Storage: Model Inference Request Flow
    Client->>Ingress: POST /v2/models/{model}/infer<br/>V2 Inference Protocol
    Ingress->>Router: Forward request<br/>(traffic split/canary)
    Router->>AGServer: Inference request<br/>REST or gRPC
    AGServer->>Storage: Load model artifacts<br/>(on first request)
    Storage-->>AGServer: Model data<br/>(TabularPredictor/TimeSeriesPredictor)
    AGServer-->>Router: Prediction response<br/>JSON
    Router-->>Ingress: Response
    Ingress-->>Client: JSON prediction result

    Note over K8sAPI,Controller: Controller Reconciliation Flow
    K8sAPI->>Controller: Watch event:<br/>InferenceService created/updated
    Controller->>K8sAPI: Create Deployment<br/>(autogluon server pod)
    Controller->>K8sAPI: Create Service
    Controller->>K8sAPI: Create Ingress/VirtualService/<br/>HTTPRoute
    Controller->>K8sAPI: Update InferenceService status

    Note over K8sAPI,Webhook: Admission Control Flow
    K8sAPI->>Webhook: Admission review:<br/>InferenceService CREATE/UPDATE
    Webhook-->>K8sAPI: Admit/Reject +<br/>defaults applied

    Note over Prometheus,RBACProxy: Metrics Collection Flow
    Prometheus->>RBACProxy: GET /metrics<br/>8443/TCP HTTPS
    RBACProxy->>RBACProxy: Validate K8s token<br/>TLS termination
    RBACProxy->>Controller: Forward to :8080<br/>HTTP (localhost)
    Controller-->>RBACProxy: Metrics response
    RBACProxy-->>Prometheus: Metrics data
